# Abstract
# --------
# Type checker and type stubs of the CI type check. `make lock` compiles
# this file together with pyproject.toml (the test, onnx, serving, zarr and
# parquet extras) and requirements-ci-test.in, so the type check resolves
# every import against the same versions as the test environment. PyTorch
# comes from requirements-ci-torch.txt, as in the test job.
#
# scipy-stubs replaces the types that pyright would otherwise infer from the
# untyped SciPy sources. It requires Python 3.12, so the type check job runs
# on Python 3.13.
# =============================================================================

pyright  # Static type checker.
scipy-stubs; python_version >= '3.12'  # Type stubs of SciPy; they need Python 3.12.

